Comment: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:11.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,出现钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:20.97,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Fate doom and future　dark over light
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:24.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru (get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.44,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:29.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru (get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:36.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,錆びついた　shadow prison　姿潜めて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:41.41,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,行き場を探しては　I keep my soul in you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:43.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,So break out so break out -> To battle the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.21,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Never give up that fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:48.75,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,So break out so break out -> To battle the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:51.42,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Don't let it claim your light rise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:56.26,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,果てなきを彷徨う　飽く無き声が
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:04:01.14,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,足枷を解いて　羽ばたくの
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.93,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,時間の狭間で召されてく魂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:06.39,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,たとえ全てを焼き尽くされたとし
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:11.06,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,ても　飲み込んで　しまえば
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:15.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,闇を振り翳して　胸に宿すアンサー
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:18.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1370,27)}闇中反転　照らして
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H0000FF&\3a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1365.333,91.001)}Aren't you? 明鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\3c&H0000FF&\3a&HFF&\pos(1370.666,35)}Won't you make yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1720,74.668)} -> 探すの
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.16,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,君を守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.79,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,そのに呼びかけるから
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:30.75,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,闇中宣戦　全身全霊　生きてゆく証
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:30.75,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs31\pos(1184,80)\bord1.2}climb back up unswayed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:33.34,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru(get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.97,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru(get out get out get out get out)
